---
source: tui/src/nori/hotkey_picker.rs
expression: "text.lines().map(str::trim_end).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\"\\n\")"
---
  Hotkeys
  Configure keyboard shortcuts

     Action                          Binding
  ▏  Open Transcript                 ctrl + t            ▕
     Open Editor                     ctrl + g
     Move Backward Char              ctrl + b
     Move Forward Char               ctrl + f
     Move to Line Start              ctrl + a
     Move to Line End                ctrl + e
     Move Backward Word              alt + b
     Move Forward Word               alt + f
     Delete Backward Char            ctrl + h
     Delete Forward Char             ctrl + d
     Delete Backward Word            ctrl + w
     Kill to Line End                ctrl + k
     Kill to Line Start              ctrl + u
     Yank                            ctrl + y
     History Search                  ctrl + r
  ↑↓/j/k move  enter rebind  r reset  esc close
